WEBVTT

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:12.260
Yuki-nee...

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.910
What do you want for Christmas this year?

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:17.820
I know! I know! I know!

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:19.160
Your breasts!

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:20.910
Huh?

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:23.240
Um...

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.350
Boobs!

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:26.620
No, you don't need to reword it.

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:29.640
Wait, that's my wish, not yours.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:33.420
You know, to sleep with you as my body pillow!

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:38.790
And you'll feel like pudding, marshmallow, or cream...

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:40.370
Cream...

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:41.850
Question!

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:43.850
What is it, Yukino-san?

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:47.060
Does a Maru-maru Banana count as a snack?

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.590
Hey! My snack!

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:51.820
So it is a snack.

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:56.610
But it's because you keep eating these at night that your belly is getting bigger than...

00:00:56.810 --> 00:00:58.580
Ow! Ow!

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:00.830
I'm sorry!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.240
Is Yuki-chan in?

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:05.610
Hey, knock before you come in.

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:09.630
Don't be so picky with your dorm mate, partner.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.160
Don't call me partner.

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:14.880
Anyway, Yuki-chan, I heard about that freshman!

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:16.260
What are you going to do?

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:18.560
What are you going to do about her, Yuki-chan?

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:20.430
Ow...

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:26.510
You know...

00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:29.010
Yuki-nee sure is taking a long time for a bathroom break.

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:32.080
And Saku-chan is with her too.

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:35.500
She must be getting a confession.

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:36.430
Huh?

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:39.030
Haven't you realized?

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:42.290
She's always following right behind you two.

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:44.830
We all knew about it.

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:47.830
Really...

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:49.420
I didn't know...

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:57.940
We've got World History II for the first hour.

00:01:57.940 --> 00:02:00.190
Are you planning to sleep straight through again?

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:01.660
But...

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:05.360
You slept right up to the break last week.

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:05.930
See? See?

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:07.840
This was you then.

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:09.600
Your drooling is so lovely!

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:11.520
Hey, hey, hey, hey...

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.980
And don't you dare mail that!

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:15.930
Erase it!

00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:19.090
Fine.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:19.820
There.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.430
Oh, a mail...

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:26.080
Wait, why did you forward that to me...

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.100
Sheesh...

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:29.160
Erase, erase...

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:35.210
I forwarded it to everyone, so it's safe even if our copies get erased.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:38.900
Kana-chan?

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:41.310
My hand really hurts...

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:44.500
That's because I'm gripping real hard.

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:45.140
So?

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:48.910
I was just kidding, Kanade-sama.

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:50.400
I'm sorry.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:53.360
All this stupid stuff...

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:55.400
Yukino-senpai! Kanade-senpai!

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:58.920
Good morning!

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:00.680
Good morning, Kamiyama-san.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:02.960
Like I said, you can call me Sakuya.

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:06.960
I'm sorry, I haven't gotten used to it yet.

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:56.290
Your feet are so warm.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:58.000
Stop it.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.010
Wear your socks.

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:01.170
No way.

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:03.510
I like your feet.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:04.990
Sheesh...

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:08.930
Say, Yuki-nee...

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:14.160
Should we stop sleeping together?

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:17.420
Are my feet cold?

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:20.110
It's not that...

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:24.980
Are you sure?

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:25.990
Yeah.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:27.090
Really?

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:28.590
Yeah.

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:30.870
Okay.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:33.450
Good night, Kana-chan.

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:37.610
Yeah, good night.

00:05:28.230 --> 00:05:29.720
Yuki-nee...

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:32.300
What's going on?

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:33.620
You better hurry or you'll be late for the next...

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:34.810
Don't leave me!

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:38.330
Don't leave me behind, Kana-chan!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.890
Yuki-chan...

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:43.900
We've been together.

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:47.840
We've always been together since we were born.

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:50.910
And I'll always...

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:56.510
always, always love you the most!

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:04.380
I...

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:08.200
I love you the most too, Yuki-chan.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.990
B-But what about Saku-chan?

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:15.630
What about her?

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:19.590
Aren't you dating...

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:20.930
I'm not!

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:24.400
She's in love with you.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:25.640
Huh?

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:30.240
I thought you were distancing yourself from me to go out with her.

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:34.740
Spill everything.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:36.820
Spill?

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:42.670
Saku-chan asked me to help her get closer to you.

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:47.380
So I was telling her all about you.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:50.250
So nothing happened between you two?

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:52.220
Did I ever mention anything?

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:55.370
No, you didn't.

00:06:57.950 --> 00:06:59.370
I see.

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:00.710
Glad to hear that.

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:03.170
Me too.

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.280
Hey, Kana-chan,

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:09.510
do you love me?

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:11.700
Love you a ton.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.390
We'll be together forever, okay?

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:15.710
Will you kiss me?

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:19.160
You did without asking when we were kids.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:22.730
A-Anyway, why did you agree to help Saku-chan?

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:28.170
I knew you'd never drift to someone else.

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:30.120
Well, you have a point...

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:31.150
Besides...

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.490
Besides?

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:35.930
She said she'd buy me snacks, so...

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.460
Ow! Ow!

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:43.680
I'm sorry!

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:44.520
Idiot.

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:20.150
Kana-chan, Kana-chan.

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:20.890
Yes?

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:22.660
Saku-chan's there again.

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:25.830
Kanade-senpai...

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:29.440
Help me out...

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:33.300
Anyway, they were really yummy.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:35.620
She really gave you snacks?!

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:36.470
Yeah.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.190
Three days worth of Maru-maru Bananas.

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:43.340
I'm in this situation because you accepted all those snacks...

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:46.420
and didn't hold up your end of the bargain!

00:09:48.090 --> 00:09:49.320
Right!

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:51.730
Ow! Ow!

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:52.450
My hand's hurting again!

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:54.130
Shut up! Shut up!

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:58.030
I'm not letting you go ever again!
